Verse 1:
[G]Just [C/G]as [G/D]I [D]am, Thine [G]own [F#dim]to [G]be,
[Bm]Friend [Am]of the [G#]young, [G#m]who [Am]lovest [D/A]me,
[D/F#]To [Bm/F#]consecrate [D/A]myself [Am]to [Em]Thee,
[F#dim]O Jesus [G]Christ, I come.

Verse 2:
[G]In [C/G]the [G/D]glad [D]morning [G]of [F#dim]my [G]day,
[Bm]My [Am]life to [G#]give, [G#m]my [Am]vows to [D/A]pay,
[D/F#]With [Bm/F#]no [G]reserve [D/A]and [E7/G#]no [Am]delay,
[F#dim]With all my [G]heart I come.

Verse 3:
[G]I [C/G]would [G/D]live [D]ever [G]in [F#dim]the [G]light,
[Bm]I [Am]would work [G#]ever [Am]for the [D/A]right;
[D/F#]I [Bm/F#]would [G]serve Thee [D/A]with [E7/G#]all [Am]my [Em]might;
[F#dim]Therefore, to [G]Thee I come.

Verse 4:
[G]Just [C/G]as [G/D]I [D]am, young, [G]strong, [F#dim]and [G]free,
[Bm]To [Am]be the [G#]best [G#m]that [Am]I can [D/A]be
[D/F#]For [Bm/F#]truth, [G]and righteousness, [Am]and [Em]Thee,
[F#dim]Lord of my [G]life, I come.
